elmer-rust — upstream attribution
=====================================

This repository is a Rust port of Elmer FEM, developed at CSC – IT Center
for Science, Finland, with numerous contributions from other organizations
and developers (see upstream contributors and `CITATION.cff`).

- Upstream: https://github.com/ElmerCSC/elmerfem
- Pinned checkout for the campaign: 9f6af2f85 (release-26.2 series)
- Upstream license: GPL-2.0 (LICENSE.md) with LGPL-2.x parts — the
  ElmerSolver main library (fem/src/*.F90) and the matc and fhutiter
  libraries are LGPL; ElmerGUI, ElmerGrid, and most solver modules are GPL
  (upstream license_texts/ElmerLicensePolicy.md).
- This port is distributed under GPL-2.0-or-later (LICENSE). LGPL-covered
  sources ported here are conveyed under GPL-2.0-or-later, as the LGPL
  allows; GPL-covered sources stay under GPL terms, which GPL-2.0-or-later
  satisfies.

If you use this port in published work, cite upstream Elmer
(Råback et al., https://www.csc.fi/web/elmer) alongside this repository.
